# Agent tooling belongs on the developer's machine, not in a health repo.
# Install skills globally instead (~/.claude/skills), so they apply to every
# project without adding weight here:
#   /plugin marketplace add nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
#   /plugin marketplace add freshtechbro/claudedesignskills
.claude/

